{"id": "q0075", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2488653568, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Jake is shopping at a clothing store. The store has a buy one get one 50% off deal on T-shirts. Jake buys 2 T-shirts. The original price of each T-shirt is $8. Then, Jake buys a pair of shoes that is 40% off the original price. The original price of the shoes is $40. What is the total amount of money Jake spends at the store?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0075.wav", "input_sha256": "718c9f89dcc1b4e187100e0c799efedf8266ac17af8f537da6046267348e8a40", "input_samples": 401600, "input_s": 25.1, "n_real_chunks": 26, "score": 0.2974, "act": 0.9991, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "T-shirts: First T-shirt: \\$8 , Second T-shirt is 50% off: \\$8 × 0.50 = \\$4 , Total for T-shirts: \\$8 + \\$4 = \\$12 Shoes: Discount: \\$40 × 0.40 = \\$16 , Sale price: \\$40 - \\$16 = \\$24 Total spent: \\$12 + \\$24 = \\$36 Final answer: 36", "expert_answer": "T-shirts:  \n- First T-shirt: \\$8  \n- Second T-shirt is 50% off: \\$8 × 0.50 = \\$4  \n- Total for T-shirts: \\$8 + \\$4 = \\$12  \n\nShoes:  \n- Discount: \\$40 × 0.40 = \\$16  \n- Sale price: \\$40 - \\$16 = \\$24  \n\nTotal spent:  \n\\$12 + \\$24 = \\$36  \n\n**Final answer: 36**", "transcript": "Jake is shopping at a clothing store. The store has a buy one get one 50 percent off deal on T-shirts. Jake buys two T-shirts. The original price of each T-shirt is 8 dollars. Then Jake buys a pair of shoes that is 40 percent off the original price. The original price of the shoes is 40 dollars. Wha", "asr_s": 1.61,