{"id": "q0517", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 717935425, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "清洁白板的步骤：", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0517.wav", "input_sha256": "11df019a27a65af8e992536d1195d65d332d447e9cd16fa2d639bb62415ca0d3", "input_samples": 24600, "input_s": 1.538, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.4158, "act": 0.9869, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "清潔白板的步驟： , 先擦掉板面字跡 用白板擦或乾淨的乾布把可擦除筆跡擦掉。 , 噴上白板清潔劑 將白板清潔液噴在板面，或噴在乾淨軟布上。 若沒有清潔劑，可用少量酒精或清水替代。 , 用軟布擦拭 以圓圈或同一方向擦拭板面，特別是有殘影、污漬的地方。 , 再用乾布擦乾 用乾淨乾布把板面擦乾，避免留下水痕。 , 檢查是否仍有殘影 若還有痕跡，可重複清潔一次。 , 保持日常保養 使用白板專用筆，不要用油性筆；清潔後讓板面完全乾燥再書寫。", "expert_answer": "清潔白板的步驟：\n\n1. **先擦掉板面字跡**  \n   用白板擦或乾淨的乾布把可擦除筆跡擦掉。\n\n2. **噴上白板清潔劑**  \n   將白板清潔液噴在板面，或噴在乾淨軟布上。  \n   若沒有清潔劑，可用少量酒精或清水替代。\n\n3. **用軟布擦拭**  \n   以圓圈或同一方向擦拭板面，特別是有殘影、污漬的地方。\n\n4. **再用乾布擦乾**  \n   用乾淨乾布把板面擦乾，避免留下水痕。\n\n5. **檢查是否仍有殘影**  \n   若還有痕跡，可重複清潔一次。\n\n6. **保持日常保養**  \n   使用白板專用筆，不要用油性筆；清潔後讓板面完全乾燥再書寫。", "transcript": "清潔白板的步驟。\n", "asr_s": 0.59, "expert_s": 7.01, "expert_input_samples": 24600, "expert_input_s": 1.538, "expert_input_sha256": "11df019a27a65af8e992536d1195d65d332d447e9cd16fa2d639bb62415ca0d3", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 6.486, "relay_synth_ms": 26094, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 337, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 337, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "15692392101f0477b5c77807a3f7ad9a9eb722d0f027d92cbc46db65f0bcf370", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 42.2}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "34347dd29d407da2b50833b7ab2a8724218c20041258f51bb2548da5ed5a7488", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0517_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "cb69660002554d74ce57df409af518a4a2fb357c217501b143da4523b4e3c687", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.52}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.077, 1.137, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.538, 1.614, 1.674, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.538, 2.614, 2.672, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.616, 4.211, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.951, 5.329, 0, 12480, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 1.538, "last_real_feed_done": 1.614, "onset": 4.211, "gate_read_done": 4.211, "fire": 4.211, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.211, "stall_note": 4.212, "stall_first_pcm": 4.874, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.329, "expert_req": 4.212, "expert_resp": 11.814, "relay_synth_start": 11.815, "relay_first_pcm": 12.656, "relay_synth_end": 37.909, "first_any_pcm": 4.211, "first_answer_pcm": 12.656, "session_end": 38.959}, "ttfa_answer_s": 11.118, "ttfa_any_s": 2.673}
{"id": "q0545", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3115533864, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "用以下词语创作一首诗：周末，日出，第一。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0545.wav", "input_sha256": "ed9f3c79abefa29521a589187281005e25d77e243bff98af3d1e2b1893c54133", "input_samples": 61800, "input_s": 3.862, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.4565, "act": 0.9807, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "周末的清晨，风还很轻， 我赶在日出之前醒来。 天边第一缕金色的光， 把沉睡的城市慢慢打开。", "expert_answer": "周末的清晨，风还很轻，  \n我赶在日出之前醒来。  \n天边第一缕金色的光，  \n把沉睡的城市慢慢打开。", "transcript": "用以下词语创作一首诗：周末、日出、第一。\n", "asr_s": 0.71, "expert_s": 1.85, "expert_input_samples": 61800, "expert_input_s": 3.862, "expert_input_sha256": "ed9f3c79abefa29521a589187281005e25d77e243bff98af3d1e2b1893c54133", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.933, "relay_synth_ms": 5710, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 423, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 423, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0545_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "33b3c889da9496c0c35d11ec080357d92e075047c1a76e8232d30f059bd74c25", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 9.92}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0545_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "f514254b31a9a3e7f0c9e441b22543f2ba022cd4f852af60c3fe59bfbf77bb00", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0545_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "c57a08718aa6f1160d3399b14f9c726105b1220c3b5d55fdc3ea0ce07bd82237", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.137, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.079, 2.14, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.076, 3.137, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.862, 3.938, 3.998, 1